*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%%%% PPD file for Samsung ML-2160 Series with rastertospl-rust
*%%%% Generated for Linux CUPS Printing Architecture
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "ML2160.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Samsung"
*% Same QPDL v3 protocol family (USB or network/Wi-Fi); listed so manual
*% and semi-automatic CUPS driver selection matches any of them.
*Product: "(ML-2160 Series)"
*Product: "(ML-2165 Series)"
*Product: "(ML-2165W Series)"
*Product: "(ML-2168 Series)"
*ModelName: "Samsung ML-2160/2165/2165W/2168 Series"
*ShortNickName: "Samsung ML-2160 Series (Rust)"
*NickName: "Samsung ML-2160/2165/2165W/2168 Series, Rust SPL2 Driver"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "20"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*% Real printers report their own model in MDL (e.g. "ML-2165W Series"), so
*% this generic ID is only a fallback; the queue is created by assigning this
*% PPD manually via `lpadmin -P`, so exact 1284DeviceID matching isn't required.
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Samsung;MDL:ML-2160 Series;CMD:SPL,FWV,EXT;"

*% ============================================================================
*% CUPS Filter Definitions (CUPS 1.x / 2.x Architecture)
*% ============================================================================
*% cupsFilter2: girdi_mimetype cikti_mimetype maliyet filtre_adi
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/octet-stream 0 rastertospl-rust"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertospl-rust"

*% ============================================================================
*% Resolution Options
*% Not: Samsung ML-2160 serisi motoru 600x600 DPI yerel (hardware native) çözünürlüğe
*% sahiptir. 1200 DPI pazarlama değeri motor interpolasyonudur.
*% "1200x600dpi" gerçek bir QPDL modudur: bu motor ailesinde 1200 DPI, dikeyde
*% 600 satır + yatayda daha hızlı lazer modülasyonu ile elde edilir. OpenPrinting
*% SpliX de aynı seçeneği ml2010/ml2015/ml1640/ml2510/ml2525 PPD'lerinde sunar.
*%
*% DİKKAT: 300x300 DPI, QPDL'de şerit (band) yüksekliğini 128'den 64'e düşürür
*% (SpliX compress.cpp: xResolution==300 && yResolution==300 -> bandHeight /= 2).
*% Filtre bunu src/main.rs `band_height_for` içinde uyguluyor. Buraya yeni bir
*% çözünürlük eklenirse o kuralın hâlâ geçerli olduğu doğrulanmalı;
*% test_band_height_matches_splix_rule_for_every_ppd_resolution bu PPD'yi
*% okuyarak her seçeneği denetliyor.
*% Not: SpliX'in kendi ml2160.ppd/ml2165.ppd dosyaları yalnızca 600dpi ve
*% 1200dpi sunar; 300dpi ve 1200x600dpi bu PPD'ye özgüdür.
*% ============================================================================
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI (Draft): "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI (Normal - Native): "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200x600dpi/1200x600 DPI (High Quality): "<</HWResolution[1200 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/1200 DPI (Best): "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ============================================================================
*% Paper Size Definitions
*% ============================================================================
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/JIS B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/No. 10 Envelope: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/DL Envelope: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/C5 Envelope: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Folio/Folio: "<</PageSize[595 935]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/JIS B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/No. 10 Envelope: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/DL Envelope: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/C5 Envelope: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Folio/Folio: "<</PageSize[595 935]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12.5 12.5 582.5 829.5"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "12.5 12.5 599.5 779.5"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "12.5 12.5 599.5 995.5"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "12.5 12.5 509.5 743.5"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "12.5 12.5 407.5 582.5"
*ImageableArea A6/A6: "12.5 12.5 284.5 407.5"
*ImageableArea B5/JIS B5: "12.5 12.5 503.5 716.5"
*ImageableArea Env10/No. 10 Envelope: "12.5 12.5 284.5 671.5"
*ImageableArea EnvDL/DL Envelope: "12.5 12.5 299.5 611.5"
*ImageableArea EnvC5/C5 Envelope: "12.5 12.5 446.5 636.5"
*ImageableArea Folio/Folio: "12.5 12.5 582.5 922.5"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension A6/A6: "297 420"
*PaperDimension B5/JIS B5: "516 729"
*PaperDimension Env10/No. 10 Envelope: "297 684"
*PaperDimension EnvDL/DL Envelope: "312 624"
*PaperDimension EnvC5/C5 Envelope: "459 649"
*PaperDimension Folio/Folio: "595 935"

*% ============================================================================
*% Paper Source (Tray)
*% ============================================================================
*% MediaPosition değerleri QPDL kağıt kaynağı kodlarıdır (SpliX printer.cpp:
*% Auto=1, Manual=2, Multi=3, Upper=4, Lower=5) ve filtre bunları doğrudan
*% QPDL sayfa başlığının 0x9 baytına yazar. Aynı numaralandırma upstream
*% SpliX'in ml1910/ml2010/ml2525/ml1640/ml2510 PPD'lerinde de var; o
*% dosyaların hepsi bu motor ailesi için yalnızca Auto ve Manual sunar
*% (ML-2160 serisinde tek kaset + elle besleme yuvası vardır, üçüncü bir
*% kaynak yoktur).
*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Auto Select: "<</MediaPosition 1>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Manual/Manual Feeder: "<</MediaPosition 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*% ============================================================================
*% Media Type
*% ============================================================================
*% Seçenek anahtarları YAZICININ PJL sözlüğüdür: filtre seçilen değeri CUPS
*% raster başlığındaki MediaType alanından okuyup doğrudan
*% "@PJL SET PAPERTYPE=<anahtar>" satırına yazar. Bu yüzden anahtarlar
*% okunabilir etiketler ("Plain", "Envelope") DEĞİL, firmware'in tanıdığı
*% kelimelerdir; kaynak upstream SpliX'in ml1910/ml2525 PPD'lerindeki
*% *MediaType listesidir. Tanınmayan bir değer gelirse filtre OFF'a düşer ve
*% stderr'e uyarı yazar.
*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: OFF
*MediaType OFF/Use Printer Default: "<</MediaType(OFF)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType NORMAL/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(NORMAL)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType THICK/Thick Paper: "<</MediaType(THICK)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType THIN/Thin Paper: "<</MediaType(THIN)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType BOND/Bond: "<</MediaType(BOND)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType OHP/Transparency: "<</MediaType(OHP)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType CARD/Card Stock: "<</MediaType(CARD)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType LABEL/Labels: "<</MediaType(LABEL)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType USED/Preprinted: "<</MediaType(USED)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType COLOR/Colored Paper: "<</MediaType(COLOR)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType ENV/Envelope: "<</MediaType(ENV)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType COTTON/Cotton: "<</MediaType(COTTON)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType RECYCLED/Recycled: "<</MediaType(RECYCLED)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType ARCHIVE/Archive: "<</MediaType(ARCHIVE)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*% ============================================================================
*% SPL2 Driver Attributes
*% ============================================================================
*QPDL QPDLVersion: "3"
*QPDL BandSize: "128"
*QPDL ManualDuplex: "On"
*QPDL PacketSize: "512"
*General DocHeaderValues: "<0><0><1>"

*% End of ML2160.PPD
